      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
      src="assets/3tentos-hero.webp"
      data-i18n-alt="altHero"
      alt="The 3tentos Web Manager shown on a laptop, a tablet and a phone, set in a soybean field."
      width="1440"
      height="794"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <hr class="rule" />
    <dl class="summary">
      <div>
        <dt data-i18n="sumRole">Role</dt>
        <dd data-i18n="sumRoleV">UX/UI Design Intern</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt data-i18n="sumTime">Timeline</dt>
        <dd data-i18n="sumTimeV">Dec 2021 - Jun 2022</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt data-i18n="sumPlat">Platform</dt>
        <dd>Desktop · Tablet · Mobile</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt data-i18n="sumTeam">Team</dt>
        <dd data-i18n="sumTeamV">PO · PM · Scrum Master · 4 Developers</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt data-i18n="sumResp">Responsibilities</dt>
        <dd data-i18n="sumRespV">Research · Usability Testing</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <section class="chapter" aria-labelledby="c-overview">
      <h2 class="t-h4" id="c-overview" data-i18n="ovTitle">01 · Overview</h2>
      <div class="chapter-body pair">
        <div>
          <h3 data-i18n="ovProbT">The problem</h3>
          <p data-i18n="ovProb">
            3tentos consultants use Terra 3, a remote agronomic monitoring platform, to recommend the best
            management for each field. Powerful but dense, the platform gives you a lot to take in when you need
            answers fast.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 data-i18n="ovGoalT">The goal</h3>
          <p data-i18n="ovGoal">
            Make a robust platform easy to read at a glance, so 135+ consultants can give about 25,000 farmers the
            right recommendation, designed around how they really work: in the field, not at a desk.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="chapter" aria-labelledby="c-research">
      <h2 class="t-h4" id="c-research" data-i18n="reTitle">02 · Research</h2>
      <figure class="chapter-body quote">
        <blockquote data-i18n="reQuote">
          “When I’m driving back from a client’s farm and pass someone else’s field, I always stop to take a look
          and jot down what I see in my notebook.”
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption data-i18n="reCap">3tentos consultant, 3 years at the company (paraphrased)</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <ul class="insights">
        <li>
          <p class="t-mono" data-i18n="i1t">Paper comes first</p>
          <p data-i18n="i1">
            Notes go into a notebook first and get typed in later, and mistakes creep in along the way.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="t-mono" data-i18n="i2t">Read at a glance</p>
          <p data-i18n="i2">Consultants need answers they can read at a glance, not charts to decode.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="t-mono" data-i18n="i3t">Life on the road</p>
          <p data-i18n="i3">Consultants spend most of the day between farms, where a laptop gets in the way.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p class="t-mono" data-i18n="i4t">Signal is a luxury</p>
          <p data-i18n="i4">Rural connectivity is spotty, so field tools have to work offline and sync later.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="chapter" aria-labelledby="c-solution">
      <h2 class="t-h4" id="c-solution" data-i18n="soTitle">03 · Solution</h2>

      <div class="feature">
        <div class="media">
          <img
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            src="assets/3tentos-hub.webp"
            data-i18n-alt="altHub"
            alt="Web Manager home on desktop: crop prices, sales against target, client plots, products and services, and R&amp;D results."
            style="--x: -3.19%; --y: -0.96%; --w: 106.39%"
            width="783"
            height="571"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="copy-col">
          <h3 class="t-h5" data-i18n="f1t">One hub for the whole crop cycle</h3>
          <p data-i18n="f1">The Web Manager home is where every tool meets, each one click away.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature flip right">
        <div class="copy-col">
          <h3 class="t-h5" data-i18n="f2t">Giving consultants the information they need</h3>
          <p data-i18n="f2">
            The client dashboard shows each farmer’s cultivated area by crop, purchased vs. delivered products and
            sales targets at a glance. I owned it end to end, from requirements to the stakeholder presentation.
            It was tested with users in the field, and the visuals were adjusted to how they understood it and
            what they needed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="media">
          <img
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            src="assets/3tentos-dashboard.webp"
            data-i18n-alt="altDash"
