    <section class="chapter" aria-labelledby="fc-redesign">
      <h2 class="t-h4" id="fc-redesign" data-i18n="fcRdTitle">05 · 2026 Redesign</h2>
      <p class="rd-sub" data-i18n="fcRdSub">
        Seven years later, I came back to Foca no Concurso with everything I’ve learned since. This is a reboot of
        the original screens: the flow we tested in 2019 stays, while the visual identity, accessibility and
        feedback get a fresh take.
      </p>

      <div class="feature">
        <div class="media">
          <img
            src="assets/foca-identity.webp"
            data-i18n-alt="fcAltId"
            alt="The new visual identity: typefaces, color palette, buttons and the redrawn seal logo."
            width="736"
            height="552"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="copy-col">
          <h3 class="t-h5" data-i18n="fcD1t">A visual identity of its own</h3>
          <p data-i18n="fcD1">
            I redrew the logo myself, giving the seal an orange headband, and that orange became the main color in
            place of the original blue, with soft tints that keep the tone friendly. Fredoka brings the playful
            side to titles, Outfit keeps longer text easy to read, and orange buttons always carry dark text for
            contrast.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature flip right">
        <div class="copy-col">
          <h3 class="t-h5" data-i18n="fcD2t">Accessible video lessons</h3>
          <p data-i18n="fcD2">
            Lessons now include captions, audio description, a transcript and a notepad, all one tap away under
            the video. The next lesson waits in a small floating bar instead of taking up space on the screen.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="media">
          <img
            class="lt"
            src="assets/foca-video.webp"
            data-i18n-alt="fcAltVid"
